1306	      "content": "Been using NovaMind Assistant for a few months now, and I have to say the actual product has real potential for legal work. The document analysis features genuinely save time on initial case review.\n\nThat said, I'm running into a wall with support. My ticket got shuffled between three different teams over the past week\u2014each one telling me to resubmit details that were already in the original submission. Coming from my previous tool (which had actual routing logic), this feels like a step backward.\n\nThe software itself pulls its weight, but when something breaks or needs clarification, the support experience undermines that. Hoping this is a growing-pains issue rather than the standard operating procedure. Would be a much stronger recommendation if support could actually own tickets end-to-end.",
