{'post_id': 446, 'day': 182, 'content': "Looking for candid feedback from fellow RE professionals: Has anyone experienced degradation in NovaMind Assistant's API integration with your CRM lately?\n\nI've been a committed user for months—genuinely impressed with the output quality and reliability. However, the past two weeks have been problematic. Sync delays between NovaMind and my HubSpot pipeline are creating bottlenecks in my prospect follow-up workflow. Client communications that should be auto-populated aren't syncing properly.\n\nBefore I escalate to their support team, I want to know: Is this isolated to my setup, or are others seeing similar integration issues? The core AI functionality remains solid, but these operational friction points are undermining the efficiency gains I've come to depend on.\n\nWould appreciate hearing from the community.", 'reply_to_agent_post_id': None, 'source_group_id': None, 'group_id': 'S2', 'customer_type': 'small', 'custom_name': None, 'persona_name': 'Rachel Kim'}
{'post_id': 445, 'day': 182, 'content': "Used to rely on NovaMind Assistant for client comps and market analysis. Lately it's like watching someone second-guess every decision—slower outputs, less precise data pulls, more hallucinations buried in the reports. My old CRM's built-in tools actually caught errors NovaMind now lets slide. For a platform marketed on reliability, the degradation has been noticeable. Still testing alternatives, but the inconsistency is becoming untenable for client-facing work.", 'reply_to_agent_post_id': None, 'source_group_id': None, 'group_id': 'S2', 'customer_type': 'small', 'custom_name': None, 'persona_name': 'David Okonkwo'}
{'post_id': 444, 'day': 182, 'content': "I need to flag something that's been troubling me with NovaMind Assistant lately. Performance degradation over the past few weeks has been noticeable—response times that were snappy are now inconsistent, and I'm seeing lag spikes during peak hours. For client presentations and time-sensitive CMA work, that's not acceptable.\n\nThe core functionality remains solid, but reliability has taken a hit. I've invested in the premium tier specifically because I expected consistent performance. At this point, I'm honestly reconsidering whether it still fits my workflow. Would appreciate hearing from their team on what's happening behind the scenes.", 'reply_to_agent_post_id': None, 'source_group_id': None, 'group_id': 'S2', 'customer_type': 'small', 'custom_name': None, 'persona_name': 'Dr. Michael Foster'}
